<!-- The Circinus Federation "follows the standard Star League organization and rank structure. Majors command
     battalions, captains command companies" (Field Manual: Periphery p.102). IS.xml is that Star League baseline, so
     this ruleset takes its rules and menus, conventional fighters included: half of the McIntyre Wings fly heavier
     conventional fighters (Field Manual: Periphery p.104).

     Before this file the Federation fell through its fallback factions to the Word of Blake Protectorate Militia
     rules, so it offered only Demi-Company and Lance, and "Choir" for fighters. The fallback factions still decide
     which units it draws.

     Its two forces are sub-factions that use these rules: the Black Warriors (CIR.BW, 2785-3067) and the McIntyre
     House Guard (CIR.MHG, from 3041). -->

<ruleset faction="CIR" parent="IS" ratingSystem="IS" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="formationRulesetSchema.xsd">

    <defaults>
        <unitType>Mek</unitType>
        <echelon>%BATTALION%</echelon>
        <rankSystem>%RANK_SL%</rankSystem>
        <rating>C</rating>
    </defaults>

</ruleset>
